1. Get keyboard pressed key in a blocking manner:
	1.1. use built-in function waitforbuttonpress
	1.2. use 'getkey' function in file exchange center: https://www.mathworks.com/matlabcentral/fileexchange/7465-getkey
	
2. Get keyboard pressed keys in a while loop in a non-blocking manner:
	use: https://stackoverflow.com/a/28915209

	close all;
	fg = figure('WindowStyle', 'modal');
	pause(10e-3);
	finish=false;
	set(fg,'CurrentCharacter','@'); % set to a dummy character
	while ~finish
		% do things in loop...

		% check for keys
		k=get(gcf,'CurrentCharacter');
		if k~='@' % has it changed from the dummy character?
			k
			set(gcf,'CurrentCharacter','@'); % reset the character
			% now process the key as required
			if k=='q', finish=true; end
		end
		pause(1e-3);
	end

